WEBVTT

00:10:27.283 --> 00:10:30.459
zdrave obroke za stotine milijuna ljudi

00:10:30.459 --> 00:10:32.101
koji ne upotrebljavaju zemljišta, 
ne troše puno vode,

00:10:32.101 --> 00:10:35.870
imaju malen ugljični otisak,

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:38.115
i isplativi su.

00:10:38.115 --> 00:10:39.300
Znamo da spašavanje oceana

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:41.102
može prehraniti svijet,

00:10:41.102 --> 00:10:43.090
i moramo započeti sada.

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:44.673
(Pljesak)

00:10:44.673 --> 00:10:47.060
Hvala vam. (Pljesak)